も","ts":"1617251331.327900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k96c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9076a984-3de3-4f92-8641-7fba5f364848","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"よくわからないけど `pairs[i].length - pairs[j].length` を先に計算しておいて `0` と比較するのではだめなのかな","ts":"1617250987.327700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mlO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f92fdf5-0007-4115-8496-0a58b6e93950","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"SSAの延長にありそうだけども。","ts":"1617249636.327500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zI8x0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35334be7-3abf-4df3-a1d0-31ee1c4c86da","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"その4ステップは最適化できる話じゃないの?","ts":"1617249629.327300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v83D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"248dc716-0bf8-4a16-ac27-d1eba5ae50ea","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"generics 入ればこれまた書ける話だなぁ。","ts":"1617249213.326700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sNk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb74bb08-a0cf-4fb5-83c0-f92e223b3d7e","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ていうか `return true` `return false` してるコードなのが趣深い","ts":"1617249145.326200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MK+s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1fe0daf-61a8-4953-a7c3-bc29c04a4d15","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"コストについては勝手に最適化してくれたほうがよいですね","ts":"1617249094.325300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4cerN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e36fcd9e-4f0d-46a4-9575-d0e2888c0bf3","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"それが必要な頻度を考えると新しい演算子導入は反対だなあ","ts":"1617249065.325200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bbYXi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19d1730f-c81f-4445-9bc7-046a2b2c6975","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```\tif pairs[i].length \u0026lt; pairs[j].length {\n\t\treturn true\n\t}\n\tif pairs[i].length \u0026gt; pairs[j].length {\n\t\treturn false\n\t}```\nが実際には\n* pairs の load\n* i の load\n* 添え字でのアクセス\n* .length の参照\nこれ2回やって cmp してだからなぁ。1回で済むという点では効果はあるかもしれない。","ts":"1617248986.325100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DVIpi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7874e665-9227-4242-8183-70034ecbab3e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ぼくらはPerlに慣れてるから `\u0026lt;=\u0026gt;` 自体には馴染みあるけど…","ts":"1617248034.323200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nIG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2c16049-2a0b-4715-9d5a-9c7f9170abb8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いやーなんかGoらしくないかなぁ…","ts":"1617247912.322400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cqyO/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"042bc1d5-9ded-43ee-91fe-2183ff1c98d9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"実際効果はあるからあってもいいかもなぁ。","ts":"1617247713.321800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zgNvv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f09e6ac9-3e71-4030-aff4-4628165b7ad6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"確実に3/31のタイムゾーンでエイプリルフールでは濁せない。","ts":"1617246107.321400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fZSEL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35d42e00-ce7a-4b10-bb07-1d50dd332d57","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"しかも提案者はカルフォルニア、バークレーだから","ts":"1617246083.320900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MTCS"}]},{"client_msg_id"